<title>JAPAN: Focus Systems to issue 25 mln Sfr CB.</title>
<headline>Focus Systems to issue 25 mln Sfr CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Focus Systems Corporation</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO		AMT   25 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.01</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>CONV FROM 26.May.97  CONV TO 21.Sep.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 12.May.97  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 23.Apr.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on April 23.</p>
